{"data":{"Draven":{"version":"16.15.1","id":"Draven","key":"119","name":"達瑞文","title":"處刑娛樂大師","blurb":"在諾克薩斯，被稱作「角鬥士」的戰士會在競技場中相互拚搏，於浴血奮戰中證明自己的實力，但從沒有人像達瑞文一樣如此享譽全境。身為一名前軍人，他發現自己誇張華麗的戰鬥本領特別受到群眾喜愛，當然他使動迴旋飛斧時無出其右的高明技巧也不在話下。沉迷於如日中天的名聲中，不可一世的達瑞文誓言要打遍天下敵手，好讓自己的名號在帝國傳頌不絕。","info":{"attack":9,"defense":3,"magic":1,"difficulty":8},"image":{"full":"Draven.png","sprite":"champion0.png","group":"champion","x":336,"y":96,"w":48,"h":48},"tags":["Marksman"],"partype":"魔力","stats":{"hp":675,"hpperlevel":104,"mp":361,"mpperlevel":39,"movespeed":330,"armor":29,"armorperlevel":4.5,"spellblock":30,"spellblockperlevel":1.3,"attackrange":550,"hpregen":3.75,"hpregenperlevel":0.7,"mpregen":8.05,"mpregenperlevel":0.65,"crit":0,"critperlevel":0,"attackdamage":62,"attackdamageperlevel":0,"attackspeedperlevel":2.7,"attackspeed":0.679}},"Garen":{"version":"16.15.1","id":"Garen","key":"86","name":"蓋倫","title":"蒂瑪西亞之力","blurb":"蓋倫高貴而有榮譽心，是無畏先鋒的一名戰士。他不僅備受同僚歡迎，也深受敵軍敬畏——尤其是身為皇冠守衛家族的名門之後，他被託付了保衛蒂瑪西亞與其理想的重責大任。身著魔法防禦盔甲，手持闊劍的蓋倫，隨時準備颳起正義的鋼鐵旋風，和戰場上的法師及魔術師展開對決。","info":{"attack":7,"defense":7,"magic":1,"difficulty":5},"image":{"full":"Garen.png","sprite":"champion1.png","group":"champion","x":384,"y":0,"w":48,"h":48},"tags":["Fighter","Tank"],"partype":"無","stats":{"hp":690,"hpperlevel":98,"mp":0,"mpperlevel":0,"movespeed":340,"armor":38,"armorperlevel":4.2,"spellblock":32,"spellblockperlevel":1.55,"attackrange":175,"hpregen":8,"hpregenperlevel":0.5,"mpregen":0,"mpregenperlevel":0,"crit":0,"critperlevel":0,"attackdamage":69,"attackdamageperlevel":0,"attackspeedperlevel":3.65,"attackspeed":0.625}},"Jade_Garen":{"version":"16.15.1","id":"Jade_Garen","key":"60086","name":"蓋倫","title":"蒂瑪西亞之力","blurb":"- 蒂瑪西亞制裁(R)造成魔法傷害","info":{"attack":7,"defense":7,"magic":1,"difficulty":5},"image":{"full":"Jade_Garen.png","sprite":"champion2.png","group":"champion","x":192,"y":0,"w":48,"h":48},"tags":["Fighter","Tank"],"partype":"無","stats":{"hp":551,"hpperlevel":96,"mp":0,"mpperlevel":0,"movespeed":345,"armor":25.7,"armorperlevel":2.7,"spellblock":31.25,"spellblockperlevel":1.25,"attackrange":125,"hpregen":8.2,"hpregenperlevel":0.75,"mpregen":0,"mpregenperlevel":0,"crit":0,"critperlevel":0,"attackdamage":55.5,"attackdamageperlevel":0,"attackspeedperlevel":2.9,"attackspeed":0.625}},"Jade_Katarina":{"version":"16.15.1","id":"Jade_Katarina","key":"60055","name":"卡特蓮娜","title":"不祥之刃","blurb":"- 彈射利刃(Q)會造成傷害並標記敵人，卡特蓮娜可以施放技能或普攻消耗標記，造成額外魔法傷害。<br>- 不祥氛圍(W)會在卡特蓮娜周圍造成傷害，若命中英雄，還會提升她的跑速。<br>- 瞬步(E)會造成傷害並瞬移到目標位置，然後賦予卡特蓮娜傷害減免。","info":{"attack":4,"defense":3,"magic":9,"difficulty":8},"image":{"full":"Jade_Katarina.png","sprite":"champion2.png","group":"champion","x":96,"y":48,"w":48,"h":48},"tags":["Assassin","Mage"],"partype":"無","stats":{"hp":505,"hpperlevel":80,"mp":0,"mpperlevel":0,"movespeed":345,"armor":24.5,"armorperlevel":3.5,"spellblock":31.25,"spellblockperlevel":1.25,"attackrange":125,"hpregen":7.5,"hpregenperlevel":0.55,"mpregen":0,"mpregenperlevel":0,"crit":0,"critperlevel":0,"attackdamage":56.2,"attackdamageperlevel":0,"attackspeedperlevel":2.74,"attackspeed":0.658}},"Jade_Kayle":{"version":"16.15.1","id":"Jade_Kayle","key":"60010","name":"凱爾","title":"審判天使","blurb":"-技能完全不同，只有「神聖祝福」(W)相同<br>-升級不會改變她的普攻<br>-「聖焰」(被動)賦予的物攻改為魔攻，魔攻改為物攻","info":{"attack":6,"defense":6,"magic":7,"difficulty":7},"image":{"full":"Jade_Kayle.png","sprite":"champion2.png","group":"champion","x":144,"y":48,"w":48,"h":48},"tags":["Mage","Marksman"],"partype":"魔力","stats":{"hp":501,"hpperlevel":93,"mp":295,"mpperlevel":40,"movespeed":335,"armor":21,"armorperlevel":3.5,"spellblock":30,"spellblockperlevel":0.75,"attackrange":125,"hpregen":7.5,"hpregenperlevel":0.75,"mpregen":7.425,"mpregenperlevel":0.325,"crit":0,"critperlevel":0,"attackdamage":56.3,"attackdamageperlevel":0,"attackspeedperlevel":2.3,"attackspeed":0.638}},"Katarina":{"version":"16.15.1","id":"Katarina","key":"55","name":"卡特蓮娜","title":"不祥之刃","blurb":"判斷精確又招招致命，卡特蓮娜是諾克薩斯當之無愧的頂尖刺客。身為傳奇將軍杜‧克卡奧的長女，卡特蓮娜以自己迅速且出敵軍不意的刺殺聞名。她熊熊燃燒的野心驅使她追尋那些戒備最森嚴，防護最完備的目標，儘管此舉常常危及她盟友的安全。無論接到的任務是甚麼，卡特蓮娜絕對會利用旋轉在她身旁的刀刃旋風，完整地執行自己的使命，毫無二心。","info":{"attack":4,"defense":3,"magic":9,"difficulty":8},"image":{"full":"Katarina.png","sprite":"champion4.png","group":"champion","x":0,"y":0,"w":48,"h":48},"tags":["Assassin","Mage"],"partype":"無","stats":{"hp":672,"hpperlevel":108,"mp":0,"mpperlevel":0,"movespeed":335,"armor":32,"armorperlevel":4.7,"spellblock":32,"spellblockperlevel":2.05,"attackrange":125,"hpregen":7.5,"hpregenperlevel":0.7,"mpregen":0,"mpregenperlevel":0,"crit":0,"critperlevel":0,"attackdamage":58,"attackdamageperlevel":0,"attackspeedperlevel":2.74,"attackspeed":0.658}},"Kayle":{"version":"16.15.1","id":"Kayle","key":"10","name":"凱爾","title":"正義天使","blurb":"凱爾在符文戰爭肆虐全世界的年代，由一個巨石峰星靈所生下。凱爾繼承母親的意志，張開環繞著聖焰的雙翼，四處為正義而戰。凱爾和雙胞胎妹妹魔甘娜多年來一直是蒂瑪西亞的守護者，但是最後她因為人類屢次失敗而感到絕望，並徹底放棄了人間。直到現在，還流傳著許多凱爾用神聖的火焰之劍懲戒世上罪惡的故事，也還有許多人在期待她終有一天能歸來","info":{"attack":6,"defense":6,"magic":7,"difficulty":7},"image":{"full":"Kayle.png","sprite":"champion4.png","group":"champion","x":48,"y":0,"w":48,"h":48},"tags":["Mage","Marksman"],"partype":"魔力","stats":{"hp":670,"hpperlevel":92,"mp":330,"mpperlevel":50,"movespeed":335,"armor":26,"armorperlevel":4.2,"spellblock":22,"spellblockperlevel":1.3,"attackrange":175,"hpregen":5,"hpregenperlevel":0.5,"mpregen":8,"mpregenperlevel":0.8,"crit":0,"critperlevel":0,"attackdamage":50,"attackdamageperlevel":0,"attackspeedperlevel":1.5,"attackspeed":0.625}},"Samira":{"version":"16.15.1","id":"Samira","key":"360","name":"煞蜜拉","title":"荒漠薔薇","blurb":"就算面對生死關頭，煞蜜拉依然毫不膽怯，繼續展現堅定自信，在險境中追求刺激。她幼時居住在蘇瑞瑪，但在家園遭到破壞後，便前往諾克薩斯，並在那裡找到自己的天職，成為鼎鼎大名的高雅傭兵，專門接最危險的任務。煞蜜拉遊走於生死邊緣，若有人膽敢擋她的路，她就會用一對火藥手槍和一柄特製大劍，輕鬆帥氣地解決他們。","info":{"attack":8,"defense":5,"magic":3,"difficulty":6},"image":{"full":"Samira.png","sprite":"champion5.png","group":"champion","x":240,"y":96,"w":48,"h":48},"tags":["Marksman","Assassin"],"partype":"魔力","stats":{"hp":630,"hpperlevel":108,"mp":349,"mpperlevel":38,"movespeed":335,"armor":26,"armorperlevel":4.7,"spellblock":30,"spellblockperlevel":1.3,"attackrange":500,"hpregen":3.25,"hpregenperlevel":0.55,"mpregen":8.2,"mpregenperlevel":0.7,"crit":0,"critperlevel":0,"attackdamage":57,"attackdamageperlevel":0,"attackspeedperlevel":3.3,"attackspeed":0.658}},"Yasuo":{"version":"16.15.1","id":"Yasuo","key":"157","name":"犽宿","title":"放逐浪人","blurb":"犽宿是一名擁有鋼鐵意志的愛歐尼亞人，亦是個行動快如疾風、可以舞動清風來斬斷敵人的劍士。只不過年輕驕傲的他，被誤認為謀殺師傅的兇手——在無法證明自己清白的情況下，為了自衛而失手殺了自己的兄長。即使在師傅的命案真相大白後，犽宿仍舊無法原諒自己所做的一切，現在他不斷地在家鄉流浪，伴隨在他的刀刃左右的唯有一股疾風。","info":{"attack":8,"defense":4,"magic":4,"difficulty":10},"image":{"full":"Yasuo.png","sprite":"champion7.png","group":"champion","x":0,"y":48,"w":48,"h":48},"tags":["Fighter","Assassin"],"partype":"風湧","stats":{"hp":590,"hpperlevel":110,"mp":100,"mpperlevel":0,"movespeed":345,"armor":32,"armorperlevel":4.6,"spellblock":32,"spellblockperlevel":2.05,"attackrange":175,"hpregen":6.5,"hpregenperlevel":0.9,"mpregen":0,"mpregenperlevel":0,"crit":0,"critperlevel":0,"attackdamage":60,"attackdamageperlevel":0,"attackspeedperlevel":3.5,"attackspeed":0.697}}}}